Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:01:34.54,HEADA,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\c&H8CDC4A&}▍{\r\fn得意黑}2026 多伦多 WTA1000 第三轮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:01:34.54,HEADB,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}伊埃拉 {\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\c&HFFFFFF&\fs44}6-3 5-7 6-4{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC} 麦克纳莉 · 赛后场上采访
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.80,0:00:02.48,EN,,0,0,0,,Clearly a tough win for that one,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.80,0:00:02.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,那一场确实赢得艰难
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.48,0:00:05.20,EN,,0,0,0,,but it is your seventh win in a row
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.48,0:00:05.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,但这已经是你的第七连胜
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.20,0:00:06.16,EN,,0,0,0,,and counting.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.20,0:00:06.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,而且还在继续
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.16,0:00:07.68,EN,,0,0,0,,This is some real momentum you're
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.16,0:00:07.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,你现在这股势头
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.68,0:00:10.16,EN,,0,0,0,,building right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.68,0:00:10.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,是真的很猛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.16,0:00:13.52,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I mean these what like two weeks
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.16,0:00:13.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,是啊 这两周
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.52,0:00:16.24,EN,,0,0,0,,have been incredible for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.52,0:00:16.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,对我来说太不可思议了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.24,0:00:18.88,EN,,0,0,0,,just so many extreme emotions
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.24,0:00:18.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,情绪起伏特别大
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.88,0:00:21.52,EN,,0,0,0,,and and I'm really I'm doing my best
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.88,0:00:21.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,我是真的在尽全力
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.52,0:00:23.12,EN,,0,0,0,,to to power
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.52,0:00:23.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,想要
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.12,0:00:26.08,EN,,0,0,0,,through and and be a professional
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.12,0:00:26.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,咬牙撑过去 保持职业
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.08,0:00:27.76,EN,,0,0,0,,and and do what I know how
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.08,0:00:27.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,做好该做的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.76,0:00:29.92,EN,,0,0,0,,to do and I mean to play in front
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.76,0:00:29.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,能在你们面前打球
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.92,0:00:31.84,EN,,0,0,0,,of you guys it's it's amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.92,0:00:31.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,真的很奇妙
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.84,0:00:37.52,EN,,0,0,0,,So I mean the motivation to to come here
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.84,0:00:37.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,想到能来这儿
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.52,0:00:39.92,EN,,0,0,0,,and play another match like
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.52,0:00:39.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,再打一场这样的比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.92,0:00:42.08,EN,,0,0,0,,it everything just becomes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.92,0:00:42.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,一切都会
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.08,0:00:47.72,EN,,0,0,0,,so much more emotional guys like
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.08,0:00:47.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,变得更加动情
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.40,0:00:51.20,EN,,0,0,0,,Like I don't know,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.40,0:00:51.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,我也说不好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.20,0:00:53.84,EN,,0,0,0,,someone in the crowd said like they wanted
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.20,0:00:53.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,看台上有人说
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.84,0:00:59.04,EN,,0,0,0,,to be Filipino for tonight and I don't know
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.84,0:00:59.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,今晚想当一次菲律宾人
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.04,0:01:02.40,EN,,0,0,0,,that I that stuck with me cuz actually I went
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.04,0:01:02.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,这句话一直留在我心里
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.40,0:01:04.08,EN,,0,0,0,,to like a Bad Bunny concert
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.40,0:01:04.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为我看过 Bad Bunny 演唱会
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.08,0:01:06.88,EN,,0,0,0,,and I felt Puerto Rican for that night.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.08,0:01:06.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,那晚我觉得自己是波多黎各人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.88,0:01:10.32,EN,,0,0,0,,So, I mean, for the Filipino community
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.88,0:01:10.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以对菲律宾社群来说
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.32,0:01:11.92,EN,,0,0,0,,to also have that impact
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.32,0:01:11.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,能带来这样的影响
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.92,0:01:13.68,EN,,0,0,0,,on on other people, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.92,0:01:13.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,对别的人也是一样
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.68,0:01:16.00,EN,,0,0,0,,the Canadians have been so hospitable
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.68,0:01:16.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,加拿大人对我特别友好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.00,0:01:16.56,EN,,0,0,0,,to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.00,0:01:16.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,待我很好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.56,0:01:18.56,EN,,0,0,0,,They've been amazing these past couple
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.56,0:01:18.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,这几天他们
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.56,0:01:19.76,EN,,0,0,0,,of days.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.56,0:01:19.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,一直都很棒
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.76,0:01:22.48,EN,,0,0,0,,So, um I really hope that, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.76,0:01:22.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以我也希望
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.48,0:01:23.76,EN,,0,0,0,,the Canadians also get
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.48,0:01:23.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,加拿大人也能感受到
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.76,0:01:27.28,EN,,0,0,0,,that feeling of hospit hospitality, sorry,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.76,0:01:27.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,那种款待的感觉 抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.28,0:01:28.32,EN,,0,0,0,,from the Filipinos.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.28,0:01:28.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,来自菲律宾人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.32,0:01:29.12,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.32,0:01:29.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.12,0:01:30.80,EN,,0,0,0,,Listen, we're going to let you get some rest,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.12,0:01:30.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,好了 让你去休息吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.80,0:01:31.20,EN,,0,0,0,,folks.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.80,0:01:31.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,各位
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.20,0:01:32.40,EN,,0,0,0,,But one last time this evening,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.20,0:01:32.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,但今晚最后一次
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.40,0:01:34.54,EN,,0,0,0,,give it up for Alexandra Eala.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.40,0:01:34.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,掌声送给伊埃拉
